# ⚡ Spark AI

**Spark AI** is a full-stack, multi-user AI assistant built with **Streamlit**, **Google Gemini**, and **Supabase**. It features persistent user authentication, cloud-synced multi-thread conversations, 4 switchable UI themes, voice chat, text-to-speech, vision & document Q&A, AI image generation, and automated PowerPoint creation.

---

## ✨ Features

* **🔐 User Authentication & Persistent Login:** Secure email/password sign-up and sign-in powered by **Supabase Auth**, with automatic session persistence across page refreshes plus a Guest Mode option.
* **☁️ Cloud-Synced Multi-Thread Chats:** Create, switch, rename, and delete multiple chat threads—privately saved per user in a **Supabase** PostgreSQL database.
* **🎨 4 Switchable UI Themes:** Customize your workspace anytime between **Dark UI**, **Dark**, **Light UI**, and **Light** modes.
* **🧠 5 AI Focus Modes:** Tailor Spark's tone and expertise (*Helpful Sidekick*, *Coding Wizard*, *Strict Logic Teacher*, *Sharp & Direct*, and *Clever Humor*).
* **👁️ Vision & Document Reader:** Upload images (`PNG`, `JPG`, `WEBP`) or documents (`PDF`, `TXT`, `CSV`, `PY`, `MD`) to analyze, summarize, and ask questions.
* **🎙️ Voice Chat & Read Aloud (TTS):** Record voice messages directly in the browser and listen to Spark's replies with one-click or automatic **gTTS** audio playback.
* **🖼️ AI Image Generation:** Generate custom high-resolution images from text prompts using **Imagen 3**.
* **📊 PowerPoint Slide Builder:** Automatically generate structured 5-slide `.pptx` presentations from any topic and download them instantly.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

* **Frontend & Themes:** [Streamlit](https://streamlit.io) + Custom CSS Theme Engine
* **AI Models:** [Google GenAI SDK](https://google.dev) (`gemini-2.5-flash` & `imagen-3.0-generate-002`)
* **Auth & Database:** [Supabase](https://supabase.com) (Supabase Auth + PostgreSQL)
* **Media & Documents:** `Pillow` (Images), `python-pptx` (Presentations), `gTTS` (Text-to-Speech)

